### REST Client Test File for CaregiverLink Operations
### Base URL: http://localhost:8080
### Seeded users:
###   - test@gmail.com      (USER, protegido)
###   - caregiver@gmail.com (CAREGIVER, cuidador)

### ============================================
### SETUP: Login
### ============================================

### 0a. Login as PROTECTED USER (test@gmail.com)
# @name loginProtected
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "test@gmail.com",
    "password": "123456"
}

### 0b. Login as CAREGIVER (caregiver@gmail.com)
# @name loginCaregiver
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "caregiver@gmail.com",
    "password": "123456"
}

### ============================================
### SUCCESS CASES
### ============================================

### 1. Generate Code - Success (as PROTECTED)
# @name generateCode
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/caregiver-links
Authorization: Bearer {{loginProtected.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 2. Accept Code - Success (as CAREGIVER)
# @name acceptCode
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/caregiver-links/{{generateCode.response.body.data.code}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCaregiver.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 3. List My Caregivers - Success (as PROTECTED)
# @name listCaregivers
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/caregiver-links
Authorization: Bearer {{loginProtected.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 4. List Whom I Care For - Success (as CAREGIVER)
# @name listCaring
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/caregiver-links/caring
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCaregiver.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 5. Revoke Link - Success (as PROTECTED)
# @name revokeLink
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/caregiver-links/{{acceptCode.response.body.data.id}}/revoke
Authorization: Bearer {{loginProtected.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### ============================================
### ERROR CASES
### ============================================

### 6. Accept code - Not found (404)
# @name acceptNotFound
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/caregiver-links/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCaregiver.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 7. Accept code - No token (401)
# @name acceptNoToken
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/caregiver-links/{{generateCode.response.body.data.code}}/accept

### 8. Revoke - Not the owner (403)
# @name revokeNotOwner
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/caregiver-links/{{acceptCode.response.body.data.id}}/revoke
Authorization: Bearer {{loginCaregiver.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 9. Generate code - No token (401)
# @name generateNoToken
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/caregiver-links